    <p style="margin-left: 3.6pt; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;">We have read the foregoing representations of our customer, __________________________ (the "Seller"), dated __________________________, with regard to our sale, for such Seller's account, of the __________________________ (Securities), represented by certificate number __________________________ of the Issuer described therein, and on&#160;behalf of ourselves we certify and affirm that (A) we have no knowledge that the transaction had been prearranged with a buyer in the United States, and (B) we have no belief that the Seller's representations set forth above are not full, true and correct, and (C) neither we, nor any person acting on our behalf, engaged in any directed selling efforts in connection with the offer and sale of such securities. Terms used herein have the meanings given to them by Regulation S.</p>
